        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">What makes you most excited about the disruptive technology space overall?</span></span></b></p>\n",
